Every managed starter website plan includes the same core package. The price changes based on how many new pages are added to your site each month — which is what drives long-term growth in Google rankings.

## What every plan includes

Regardless of which tier you choose, every managed starter website comes with:

- **Professional website build** — designed and built by NC Digital, live within 5–7 days
- **Custom domain** — your own .co.uk or .com address, registered and managed for you
- **Fast hosting with SSL** — secure, reliable hosting included at no extra cost
- **Daily backups** — your site is backed up automatically every day
- **Small content changes** — need to update a price or swap a photo? Just ask
- **Enquiry forms** — so potential customers can contact you directly from your site
- **Case studies** — showcase your work as part of the site
- **Ongoing technical management** — updates, security patches, and maintenance handled for you
- **SEO foundations on every page** — proper titles, descriptions, and structure so Google can find you

## The three plans

### Starter — £20/month inc. VAT
**5 new pages added per month**

Best for getting online and growing steadily. Over a year, you'll have added 60 new pages to your site — 60 more opportunities to rank for the services and locations your customers are searching for.

### Growth — £35/month inc. VAT *(most popular)*
**10 new pages added per month**

Best for service-area growth and regular content. Ten pages per month means 120 new ranking opportunities per year. This is the tier most clients choose once they understand how much faster a growing site outperforms a static one.

### Scale — £50/month inc. VAT
**unlimited new pages added per month**

Best for faster expansion across services and locations. Ideal for businesses covering multiple towns or offering a wide range of services, where there are lots of relevant searches to target.

## How to choose

If you want to get online affordably and grow steadily, Starter is the right fit. If you're in a competitive area or want to build your search presence faster, Growth is the most common choice. Scale suits businesses with a broad geographic or service range to cover.

All plans have a 6-month minimum term, then roll monthly with 30 days' notice to cancel.

[Sign up for a managed starter website](/services/managed-starter-websites/) or [get in touch to talk through which plan suits your business](/contact/).
